// Decision 24's first judgment: is the direct-page pool a linker resource
// rather than a frontend one?  Part one.
//
// Two units, each asking the pool for part of a page.  Neither can see the
// other's claim - K816 compiles one unit at a time - so what makes the two
// fit together is ld65's `ZEROPAGE` segment, which the configuration sizes.

import "pool_b.k65"

@a8
@i8

var dp scratch_a[3]
